sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Driver as Driver
  participant UI as Driver UI
  participant API as Backend API
  participant DB as DB
  participant ST as Photo Storage
  participant M as Manager UI

  Driver->>UI: Open assigned vehicle
  UI->>API: Create inspection draft
  API->>DB: Insert inspections (draft)
  DB-->>API: inspection_id
  API-->>UI: Draft created

  loop Checklist items
    Driver->>UI: Set pass/fail, add comment
    alt Photo required
      Driver->>UI: Add photo
      UI->>ST: Upload file
      ST-->>UI: photo_url
    end
  end

  Driver->>UI: Draw signature
  UI->>API: Submit inspection data
  API->>DB: Upsert inspection_results
  API->>DB: Update inspections (submitted)
  API-->>UI: Submission completed

  M->>API: Open report
  API->>DB: Read inspection + results
  API-->>M: Structured report + photos
